-- 1. USERS
-- Users are NOT seeded. They are created dynamically through the application's
-- signup/authentication flow (Supabase Auth + public.users table).

-- 2. MANDIS (585+ APMCs)
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
SELECT setval('public.mandis_id_seq', (SELECT MAX(id) FROM public.mandis));

-- 3. COMMODITY PRICES & TRANSACTIONAL DATA
-- All commodity prices are fetched dynamically in real-time from the official
-- Government of India Data.gov.in / Agmarknet (NIC) and CACP / Agricoop MSP APIs.
-- No synthetic prices are seeded into commodity_prices.
--
-- NOTE: produce_lots, rfqs, rfq_messages, contracts, escrow_payments, disputes,
-- and notifications are NOT seeded. All transactional data is created dynamically
-- through the application UI by verified farmers, FPOs, and buyers.
